[TITLE]
Greater Chennai storm water drain network
Extracted from the GCC / SECON-JBA ward base maps (2021 survey).
Subcatchments are Thiessen cells around each manhole.

[OPTIONS]
FLOW_UNITS           CMS
INFILTRATION         HORTON
FLOW_ROUTING         DYNWAVE
LINK_OFFSETS         DEPTH
MIN_SLOPE            0
ALLOW_PONDING        NO
SKIP_STEADY_STATE    NO
START_DATE           11/30/2015
START_TIME           00:00:00
END_DATE             12/08/2015
END_TIME             00:00:00
REPORT_STEP          00:15:00
WET_STEP             00:05:00
DRY_STEP             01:00:00
ROUTING_STEP         0:00:15

